<p style="text-indent: 0.5in; line-height: 200%; margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;">A client discloses that she is struggling with depression. She says she is having intrusive thoughts about her children being killed. She admits she is no longer letting her kids sit in the front room of the house because she is afraid a bullet from outside will hit them. They are not allowed to play outside, and she is considering home school because she feels they are unsafe at school. She relays she has not slept for a week and is hopeless that anything will help.</span></p></body></html>